name: sim.closeModule
description: 
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.closeModule(int sim.handle_all)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. sim.handle_all: indicates that all plugins should be closed
2. moduleName: the name of a specific plugin that should be closed
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. result: the number of plugins that executed the command.
